<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Rayon -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Rayon -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		121.12		vs	  116.07</p>
<p> Operating	    7.37		vs	    4.00</p>
<p> Current		6.90		vs	    3.02</p>
<p> Net		    3.22		vs	    1.30</p>
<p> EPS		    5.14 yen	  vs	    2.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    627 million	  vs	 627 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Rayon Co Ltd is a top acrylic fibre maker.</p>
